# Flex Beat: the FX menu's third bank (the SELECT dial twice): fifteen one-bar patterns. A tapped pad latches; it waits for the bar
# (Quantize: bar), plays its bar, and one shot lets the latch go.
seed 0
wait 3000
tap FX
wait 100
spin SELECT 1
wait 100
spin SELECT 1
wait 100
expect fxbank 2
shot flex_bank.png
tapkey 2
wait 100
expect flexlast 2
wait 7000
expect flexdone 1
expect flexstate 0
expect fxmaskhi 0
# held (not tapped): it plays while the pad is down and the bar plays out; held through its end it does not start again
key 5 down
wait 9000
expect flexdone 2
expect flexstate 0
key 5 up
wait 300
expect flexlast 5